es are retained. Six core falsifiable propositions address incremental validity, regulatory architecture, matching and uptake, dyadic transmission and co-dysregulation, non-linear dosage constraints, and relational-training specificity. The model generates a research agenda based on perturbation-centered time series, representative simulations, quasi-experimental designs, and converging within-person evidence.", "doi": "10.3389/fpsyg.2026.1940453", "pmid": "42908555", "pmcid": "PMC13683087", "source": "MED", "fullTextUrlList": {"fullTextUrl": [{"availability": "Subscription required", "availabilityCode": "S", "documentStyle": "doi", "site": "DOI", "url": "https://doi.org/10.3389/fpsyg.2026.1940453"}, {"availability": "Open access", "availabilityCode": "OA", "documentStyle": "html", "s

